  "description": "The meme implies that the boys are 'incompatible with Western values' — a concept that requires external knowledge of Western cultural norms and political ideologies. This is a key part of the meme’s harmful message, as it frames the boys as a threat to the social order of Western societies, which is a common xenophobic trope.",
